{"id":"ceb241b03d936136","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-turing-reduction.md","title":"Turing Reduction","display":"df-turing-reduction — Turing Reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-turing-reduction","aliases":["88-df-turing-reduction"],"display":"df-turing-reduction — Turing Reduction","depends_on":["[[88-df-oracle-tm]]","[[88-df-oracle-computation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-turing-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-turing-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-reduction — Turing Reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"47142c2c72e0fb46\" href=\"?note=47142c2c72e0fb46\" title=\"88-df-oracle-tm\">88-df-oracle-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" href=\"?note=baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" title=\"88-df-oracle-computation\">88-df-oracle-computation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (target and oracle sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M_e^B,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M_e^B,B)\\)</span> (indexed oracle machine, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"47142c2c72e0fb46\" href=\"?note=47142c2c72e0fb46\" title=\"88-df-oracle-tm\">88-df-oracle-tm</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^B\">\\(\\varphi_e^B\\)</span> (partial function computed relative to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" href=\"?note=baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" title=\"88-df-oracle-computation\">88-df-oracle-computation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\">\\(\\leq_T\\)</span> (Turing-reducibility relation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash\nA\\leq_TB\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M_e^B,B)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^B)=\\mathbb N\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\n(\\langle n,1\\rangle\\in\\varphi_e^B\\leftrightarrow n\\in A)\n\\land(\\langle n,0\\rangle\\in\\varphi_e^B\\leftrightarrow n\\notin A)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash\nA\\leq_TB\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M_e^B,B)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^B)=\\mathbb N\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\n(\\langle n,1\\rangle\\in\\varphi_e^B\\leftrightarrow n\\in A)\n\\land(\\langle n,0\\rangle\\in\\varphi_e^B\\leftrightarrow n\\notin A)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\leq_TB\">\\(A\\leq_TB\\)</span> 当且仅当某个以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 为 oracle 的全计算给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的特征函数。</li>\n<li>定义不再把普通判定器谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decides}_{M}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Decides}_{M}(A)\\)</span> 错用于 oracle 机器。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-oracle-tm","status":"resolved","id":"47142c2c72e0fb46","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-oracle-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"baf8d9aebf7edfa1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-tm","status":"resolved","id":"47142c2c72e0fb46","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M_e^B,B)$ (indexed oracle machine, see [[88-df-oracle-tm]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"baf8d9aebf7edfa1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi_e^B$ (partial function computed relative to $B$, see [[88-df-oracle-computation]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M_e^B,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}reduction} \\vdash\nA\\leq_TB\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{OracleTM}(M_e^B,B)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^B)=\\mathbb N\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\n(\\langle n,1\\rangle\\in\\varphi_e^B\\leftrightarrow n\\in A)\n\\land(\\langle n,0\\rangle\\in\\varphi_e^B\\leftrightarrow n\\notin A)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"A\\leq_TB","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Decides}_{M}(A)","display":false}],"bytes":1166,"backlinks":[{"id":"a8bec8cb4c1a4891","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leq_T$ (Turing reducibility, see [[88-df-turing-reduction]])"},{"id":"fbf21d26a14b4aa1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leq_T$ (Turing reducibility, see [[88-df-turing-reduction]])"},{"id":"1d37344e2980aa69","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数